option.EXPOSURE=Exposure (stops)
option.SATURATION=Saturation
option.CONTRAST=Contrast
option.TEMPERATURE=Temperature
option.TINT=Tint
option.GRAYSCALE=Grayscale
option.EXPOSURE.comment=Brightness in stops. Zero leaves the scene unchanged.
option.SATURATION.comment=One is neutral. Zero removes color.
option.CONTRAST.comment=One is neutral. Adjusts contrast around mid-gray.
option.TEMPERATURE.comment=Zero is neutral. Negative is cooler; positive is warmer.
option.TINT.comment=Zero is neutral. Negative adds green; positive adds magenta.
option.GRAYSCALE.comment=Optional weighted grayscale after other color controls.

option.DEBUG_VIEW=Debug View
option.DEBUG_VIEW.comment=Raw surface buffers bypass color grading. Black means no recorded surface.
value.DEBUG_VIEW.0=Normal Rendering
value.DEBUG_VIEW.1=View-space Normals
value.DEBUG_VIEW.2=Lightmap: Red Block / Green Sky
value.DEBUG_VIEW.3=Directional NdotL
option.LIGHTING_STRENGTH=Directional Lighting Strength
option.LIGHTING_STRENGTH.comment=Zero restores Milestone 1 scene lighting.
option.AMBIENT_LIGHT=Ambient Factor
option.AMBIENT_LIGHT.comment=Lighting floor for sky-exposed surfaces. Caves retain original lightmap lighting.
option.DIRECT_LIGHT=Direct Light Factor
option.DIRECT_LIGHT.comment=Strength of the Lambert directional term before shadow visibility.

value.DEBUG_VIEW.4=Raw Shadow Depth
option.SHADOWS_ENABLED=Shadows Enabled
option.SHADOWS_ENABLED.comment=Apply cast shadows to direct light. Off restores Milestone 2 lighting; the map remains available in debug 4.
option.SHADOW_BIAS=Shadow Bias
option.SHADOW_BIAS.comment=Constant mode only. Normalized depth offset. Increase to reduce acne; too much detaches shadows.

option.SHADOW_FILTER=Shadow Filtering
value.SHADOW_FILTER.0=Hard
value.SHADOW_FILTER.1=3x3 PCF
value.SHADOW_FILTER.2=5x5 PCF
value.SHADOW_FILTER.3=Poisson PCF
option.SHADOW_FILTER.comment=Hard: 1 tap. 3x3: 9. 5x5: 25. Poisson: 8 irregular samples to reduce grid-like filtering patterns; quality needs comparison.
option.SHADOW_SOFTNESS=Shadow Softness
option.SHADOW_SOFTNESS.comment=Grid tap spacing or Poisson disk radius multiplier in texels. Same value gives different footprints. Default 1; zero matches Hard. Ignored in Hard mode.
value.DEBUG_VIEW.5=Shadow Visibility (Filtered)

option.SHADOW_BIAS_MODE=Shadow Bias Mode
option.SHADOW_BIAS_MODE.comment=Constant uses Shadow Bias everywhere. Angle-Aware uses more tolerance at grazing light angles; a receiver heuristic, not raster slope bias.
value.SHADOW_BIAS_MODE.0=Constant
value.SHADOW_BIAS_MODE.1=Angle-Aware
option.SHADOW_BIAS_MIN=Angle-Aware Min Bias
option.SHADOW_BIAS_MIN.comment=Tolerance when facing the light. Only used by Angle-Aware; reversed bounds are sorted.
option.SHADOW_BIAS_MAX=Angle-Aware Max Bias
option.SHADOW_BIAS_MAX.comment=Tolerance at grazing angles. Excess can detach shadows or leak light. Only used by Angle-Aware.
value.DEBUG_VIEW.6=Effective Shadow Bias

screen.ATMOSPHERE=Aurora Sky and Light
option.SKY_STYLE=Sky Style
value.SKY_STYLE.0=Base-330
value.SKY_STYLE.1=Aurora Fantasy
option.SKY_STYLE.comment=Azure days, coral/gold twilight and indigo nights. Open skylit dimensions only.
option.SKY_BLEND=Aurora Sky Blend
option.SKY_BLEND.comment=Zero restores the old sky exactly. Does not change sun, moon or star textures.
option.SUNSET_GLOW=Sunset Warmth
option.SUNSET_GLOW.comment=Broad warm color toward the sun near the horizon. This is not bloom.
option.NIGHT_BRIGHTNESS=Night Sky Brightness
option.NIGHT_BRIGHTNESS.comment=Changes only the night sky palette; does not brighten terrain or caves.
option.LIGHT_PALETTE=Celestial Light Colors
value.LIGHT_PALETTE.0=Neutral M6
value.LIGHT_PALETTE.1=Aurora
option.LIGHT_PALETTE.comment=Warm sunlight and cool ambient/moonlight. Cave and block-light protection remain.
option.LIGHT_PALETTE_STRENGTH=Light Color Strength
option.LIGHT_PALETTE_STRENGTH.comment=Zero preserves the M6 lighting result. Strong block light reduces the tint.

screen.COLOR_PIPELINE=Scene Color and Highlights
option.SCENE_COLOR_MODE=Scene Color Pipeline
value.SCENE_COLOR_MODE.0=M7 Display / LDR
value.SCENE_COLOR_MODE.1=Linear / HDR Composition
option.SCENE_COLOR_MODE.comment=Linear mode uses RGBA16F, linear blending and final tone mapping. Baked Minecraft lightmap shading is retained.
option.TONE_MAPPING=Highlight Mapping
value.TONE_MAPPING.0=Clip
value.TONE_MAPPING.1=Soft Shoulder
option.TONE_MAPPING.comment=HDR mode only. Soft Shoulder compresses bright colors while preserving linear RGB ratios before grading.
option.TONEMAP_KNEE=Highlight Shoulder Start
option.TONEMAP_KNEE.comment=HDR mode only. Linear intensity below this value is unchanged; higher values are compressed smoothly.

screen.FOG=Distance and Height Fog
option.FOG_ENABLED=Atmospheric Fog
value.FOG_ENABLED.0=Off
value.FOG_ENABLED.1=On
option.FOG_ENABLED.comment=Linear scene mode only. Recorded opaque surfaces plus known late terrain, weather and particle paths.
option.FOG_DENSITY=Fog Density
option.FOG_DENSITY.comment=Extinction per block near the reference height. Zero restores the unfogged scene.
option.FOG_START=Clear Near Distance
option.FOG_START.comment=Distance from the camera before new atmosphere begins, in blocks.
option.FOG_BASE_HEIGHT=Fog Reference Height
option.FOG_BASE_HEIGHT.comment=World height below which density stops increasing.
option.FOG_HEIGHT_FALLOFF=Fog Height Scale
option.FOG_HEIGHT_FALLOFF.comment=Larger values let dense fog extend higher above the reference height.
option.FOG_RAIN_BOOST=Rain Fog Increase
option.FOG_RAIN_BOOST.comment=Extra density in rain. One doubles clear-weather density at full rain strength.

screen.BLOOM=Controlled Bloom
option.BLOOM_ENABLED=Bloom
value.BLOOM_ENABLED.0=Off
value.BLOOM_ENABLED.1=On
option.BLOOM_ENABLED.comment=Soft highlight spread in linear scene mode; bypassed in debug views. The four passes remain allocated when off.
option.BLOOM_STRENGTH=Bloom Strength
option.BLOOM_STRENGTH.comment=Amount added before final exposure and tone mapping. Zero preserves the original scene exactly.
option.BLOOM_THRESHOLD=Bloom Threshold
option.BLOOM_THRESHOLD.comment=Peak scene-linear RGB before exposure. Bright sky and held items can contribute; this is not a material emission mask.
option.BLOOM_SOFT_KNEE=Bloom Soft Transition
option.BLOOM_SOFT_KNEE.comment=Fraction of threshold used for the transition half-width. Zero gives a hard threshold; larger values admit some lower highlights.

screen.AURORA=Aurora Night Ribbons
option.AURORA_ENABLED=Night Aurora
value.AURORA_ENABLED.0=Off
value.AURORA_ENABLED.1=On
option.AURORA_ENABLED.comment=Teal and violet sky ribbons toward north on clear nights. Requires Aurora Sky and linear scene mode; does not illuminate terrain.
option.AURORA_INTENSITY=Aurora Intensity
option.AURORA_INTENSITY.comment=Linear light added to the upper sky only. Zero preserves the original sky; also fades with Sky Blend, rain and vision effects.
option.AURORA_SPEED=Aurora Motion
value.AURORA_SPEED.0=Frozen
value.AURORA_SPEED.1=Normal
value.AURORA_SPEED.2=Double
option.AURORA_SPEED.comment=Periodic 200-second motion at normal speed. Frozen uses the fixed zero phase, not the current frame.
